Description: A collection of custom KQL detection and hunting queries developed to surface anomalous behavior in enterprise environments.
this is a sample of a brute force detection

SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| where EventID == 4625 // Failed Logon
| summarize FailedLogons=count() by Account, IpAddress
| where FailedLogons > 10
| sort by FailedLogons desc
